// Regression: an undefined variable used as an OPERATOR argument must
// still surface a diagnostic. The `__op_*` arg-inference path used to
// `Err(_) => continue` (silently skip the check), so a broken `x + y`
// produced wrong types while the same shape in a regular call errored.
// The operators-as-functions arc rewrote that arm to propagate via `?`;
// this pins the symmetry so it cannot silently regress.
//=== TEST CASE: undefined_in_operator_arg_Generic ===
fn main() {
    let r = undefined_thing + 1
}